WEBVTT

00:31.114 --> 00:33.950
THE TRUNK

00:35.827 --> 00:37.579
SORRY, I'M GOING TO BE LATE
I'LL BE THERE SOON

00:37.662 --> 00:40.749
Hurry up before some other guy
finds me in this dress.

00:48.381 --> 00:49.549
Love you, babe!

00:52.802 --> 00:54.429
31,306 VIEWS

00:57.223 --> 01:01.061
PLEASE HELP MY DAUGHTER
WHO'S FALLEN FOR A MARRIAGE SCAM

01:08.318 --> 01:09.652
SB ELECTRONICS SEO'S SEX TAPE

01:17.577 --> 01:20.705
ONE DAY, MY DAUGHTER BROUGHT HOME
A MAN SHE WANTED TO MARRY…

01:20.789 --> 01:23.541
…I FOUND OUT THAT HE'S A BISEXUAL
WHO'S USING MY DAUGHTER

01:25.126 --> 01:28.171
5 YEARS AGO, 10 DAYS BEFORE THE WEDDING

04:29.435 --> 04:32.522
I see you canceled
three days before the ceremony.

04:32.605 --> 04:34.357
There's a 70% cancellation fee

04:34.440 --> 04:36.776
if it's three to five days
before the ceremony.

04:36.859 --> 04:38.194
You'll get a 30% refund.

04:38.820 --> 04:41.447
It takes two weeks
for the transaction to go through.

04:43.241 --> 04:44.909
We just need your signature here.

05:10.727 --> 05:12.103
Excuse me. Sorry.

05:12.687 --> 05:14.647
But did you lose this, by any chance?

05:19.986 --> 05:21.571
So it is yours. I thought so.

05:22.155 --> 05:23.781
I just found it in the bathroom.

05:23.865 --> 05:25.616
You must've left it there.

05:31.372 --> 05:34.125
I was throwing it away.
Take it if you want.

05:34.625 --> 05:35.793
I don't care anyway.

05:37.420 --> 05:40.590
Wait, but it's a wedding ring.
So why'd you get divorced?

05:45.011 --> 05:49.515
Or, um, how'd you fall for someone
who swings both ways, huh, Ms. Noh?

06:01.486 --> 06:04.489
Lee Seon. Hello.
Corporate operations management.

06:06.532 --> 06:07.909
I'm also the CEO of NM.

06:07.992 --> 06:08.951
LEE SEON, CEO

06:11.287 --> 06:14.123
First, I'm supposed to pay
some sort of cancellation fee.

06:15.375 --> 06:18.044
Now you wanna analyze what kind of woman
would cancel her own wedding

06:18.127 --> 06:19.545
three days before.

06:20.421 --> 06:22.465
You gonna give me a survey, or…

06:23.633 --> 06:26.469
I have a proposal as the CEO.

06:27.512 --> 06:30.932
I need someone suited for…
temporary marriages.

06:32.016 --> 06:34.477
This employee would have
a different assignment every year.

06:34.560 --> 06:38.898
It would be a C-suite level salary,
not to mention bonuses and full benefits.

06:39.607 --> 06:40.566
Sound good?

06:42.693 --> 06:44.821
A temp… what now?

06:46.906 --> 06:49.534
What's so great about marriage anyway,
ya know?

06:50.243 --> 06:53.788
Maybe it's your fault
for wanting an extravagant ceremony.

06:54.372 --> 06:55.623
Wanting to show off.

06:56.833 --> 07:00.837
You might've avoided all this, hmm,
if both of you had just gone off together.

07:02.880 --> 07:04.882
Was it the attention? The recognition?

07:05.466 --> 07:08.886
Did it matter that much to you?
Is that it, Ms. Noh?

07:18.104 --> 07:20.022
Please. You obviously don't know shit.

07:21.899 --> 07:23.443
It could become a career.

07:24.277 --> 07:26.195
Think of marriage as a profession.

07:26.279 --> 07:27.989
It might solve a lot of issues.

07:31.909 --> 07:34.287
You could think of it as revenge,
if you will.

07:39.333 --> 07:45.256
THE TRUNK

07:47.091 --> 07:49.260
I'm heading straight
to the ER, okay?

07:49.886 --> 07:52.513
We'll be there in ten. No, five.

07:53.431 --> 07:54.307
Okay?

08:18.873 --> 08:21.792
I'm gonna give you a shot.
You'll feel a slight prick.

09:01.207 --> 09:02.333
Han Jeong-won?

09:09.173 --> 09:12.093
What are you doing here?
Visiting your father?

09:13.094 --> 09:14.178
Actually, no.

09:14.262 --> 09:16.389
You might as well since you're here.

09:16.973 --> 09:20.351
This hospital has around-the-clock care
and top-notch medical staff.

09:21.227 --> 09:22.687
He doesn't need me right now.

09:23.771 --> 09:25.356
But still, don't you think you…

09:25.856 --> 09:27.316
Just call me when he passes.

09:27.817 --> 09:29.360
I'll stop by then to grieve.

09:38.953 --> 09:39.996
Ingrate.

09:42.623 --> 09:44.458
NEW NOTIFICATION FROM NM

09:47.920 --> 09:49.380
REQUEST KEEPER DISPATCH?
NO

09:53.718 --> 09:56.220
I'll make sure
it doesn't leave a scar. Don't worry.

09:57.722 --> 10:00.516
A little more to the side
and it would have dropped on your head.

10:00.600 --> 10:03.519
You got really lucky.
It was almost a lot worse.

10:03.603 --> 10:06.355
And listen, some people aren't worth
the pain and suffering.

10:06.439 --> 10:07.690
You barely know me.

10:09.025 --> 10:11.027
Wait, is that part of
the company handbook?

10:12.069 --> 10:14.780
Well, usually,
letting your husband get impaled

10:15.865 --> 10:18.075
doesn't look great
on a performance review.

10:21.579 --> 10:25.666
You think we could pick up some burgers
since I saved your life? I'm super hungry.

10:33.507 --> 10:36.802
Two cheeseburger combos,
and one with no tomatoes, please.

10:36.886 --> 10:38.971
All right. We'll have that ready soon.

10:52.109 --> 10:54.403
Two cheeseburger combos.
Thank you. Enjoy.

10:55.071 --> 10:55.988
Thank you.

11:22.640 --> 11:23.724
Something wrong?

11:24.725 --> 11:26.686
Yeah, I'm a vegetarian, actually.

11:32.400 --> 11:34.110
Should've told them no tomatoes,
that's all.

11:40.449 --> 11:41.659
That was pretty funny.

11:43.035 --> 11:44.328
No tomatoes, huh?

11:44.412 --> 11:45.663
Do you like tomatoes?

11:45.746 --> 11:46.580
No.

11:47.915 --> 11:50.418
Let's vow that our salads
will never have tomatoes.

12:48.309 --> 12:50.728
We better clean that. It'll get worse.

13:01.363 --> 13:03.032
So can I ask you a question?

13:03.115 --> 13:04.033
Sure. What?

13:05.618 --> 13:08.662
- Which marriage are you on?
- This is number five.

13:12.333 --> 13:13.209
Oh.

13:16.545 --> 13:19.924
Does marriage…
help you live a better life?

13:20.549 --> 13:23.552
Do you like it enough… to do it for work?

13:23.636 --> 13:26.472
I think it's my turn.
You asked me, like, four things.

13:30.768 --> 13:32.812
Why do you hate that light fixture, huh?

13:36.690 --> 13:39.109
Who said there's something wrong with it?

13:39.693 --> 13:41.278
It was pretty clear, honestly.

13:42.029 --> 13:43.781
Come on. You wouldn't even look at it.

13:47.618 --> 13:48.994
We should take off soon.

14:25.823 --> 14:27.658
I asked Mr. Kim
to take care of it.

14:28.909 --> 14:31.745
I still have help, even though
I don't like people coming in and out.

14:32.580 --> 14:34.373
Let 'em know if you want anything.

15:14.538 --> 15:16.248
Stop bitching!

16:01.961 --> 16:02.795
Here, I got it.

16:03.295 --> 16:05.422
I'm sorry. My hand slipped.

16:06.382 --> 16:09.259
I don't usually eat breakfast,
so you're off the hook.

16:10.511 --> 16:11.762
I do though.

16:11.845 --> 16:13.472
Then just order something.

16:15.766 --> 16:17.518
I don't wanna have to think about it.

16:20.396 --> 16:21.981
All right, I should head out.

16:22.564 --> 16:23.524
To do what?

16:24.566 --> 16:25.693
Meetings. That's all.

16:26.402 --> 16:29.154
You can come back for supper, right?
I'll wait for you.

16:33.826 --> 16:35.202
Can I borrow your car?

16:35.953 --> 16:38.038
Sure, whatever. Pick any of them.

16:46.964 --> 16:48.674
So he's got meetings?

18:02.873 --> 18:04.875
So who's this woman you're marrying?

18:06.126 --> 18:07.878
Uh, you wouldn't know her, all right?

18:07.961 --> 18:10.547
Sure. That's bullshit.
I know everyone.

18:11.048 --> 18:12.925
So just tell me. Who is she?

18:24.186 --> 18:25.604
Seo-yeon introduced us.

18:26.271 --> 18:28.023
Lee Seo-yeon introduced you guys?

18:28.774 --> 18:30.192
And so you just agreed?

18:30.275 --> 18:32.820
She swore she'd take me back
if I do it for a year.

18:35.489 --> 18:36.573
All right.

18:38.200 --> 18:40.744
Two peas in a fucking pod, huh?
You guys are nuts.

18:41.370 --> 18:44.331
I don't even wanna know
what the hell is going on in your heads.

18:44.873 --> 18:47.751
Question is, what's our newlywed husband
doing here so early?

18:48.252 --> 18:49.128
It's awkward.

18:49.211 --> 18:50.295
What is?

18:50.379 --> 18:52.339
Because of me, the lady, she…

18:54.341 --> 18:55.217
she got hurt.

18:55.801 --> 18:57.928
She probably doesn't want me
around right now.

18:58.011 --> 19:01.140
You guys… moved in together? Already?

19:53.275 --> 19:54.776
Everything's fine. I told you.

19:55.277 --> 19:57.112
Well, it left
computerized medical records,

19:57.196 --> 19:59.531
so the procedures here are
a little more complicated.

19:59.615 --> 20:00.908
You get it, don't you?

20:03.368 --> 20:05.120
Was there any violence or abuse?

20:05.621 --> 20:06.663
Uh, no.

20:07.414 --> 20:10.042
Were you vulnerable
to potential violence or abuse?

20:10.125 --> 20:11.084
Again, no.

20:11.960 --> 20:14.796
Do you anticipate
any future acts of violence or abuse?

20:17.382 --> 20:19.551
Please reach out
if a code situation arises.

20:19.635 --> 20:21.595
The keepers will remain on standby.

20:22.596 --> 20:23.555
Oh, uh…

20:24.264 --> 20:25.182
Yes?

20:35.859 --> 20:36.860
Uh, nothing.

21:41.883 --> 21:44.094
Hmm.
I don't like what I'm seeing here.

21:44.177 --> 21:45.637
The inflammation doesn't look good.

21:45.721 --> 21:47.889
I think we should take out your IUD.

21:48.473 --> 21:50.434
Have you considered freezing your eggs?

21:51.018 --> 21:52.978
Well, no. I don't plan
on getting pregnant.

21:53.061 --> 21:55.022
Well, you might wanna
think about it for a bit--

21:55.105 --> 21:56.398
Hey, I said no!

21:59.943 --> 22:02.487
Let's switch out your IUD and take a beat.
That sound good to you?

22:04.573 --> 22:08.076
Wait, you didn't hear?
I guess that woman protected Jeong-won

22:08.160 --> 22:11.788
when that expensive chandelier thing
fell down and almost smashed his skull.

22:12.748 --> 22:14.666
So is he… is he hurt?

22:14.750 --> 22:16.251
Oh, I'm sure he's okay, but…

22:16.335 --> 22:17.461
Well, apparently,

22:18.086 --> 22:21.757
the woman's arm got a massive cut,
and she had to be rushed to the ER.

22:21.840 --> 22:24.301
Is that true though?
Sounds exaggerated, for sure.

22:24.384 --> 22:26.678
I know!
Still, it was heroic, don't you think?

22:26.762 --> 22:28.972
I doubt I would've done that.
Not a chance.

22:29.931 --> 22:32.642
For her to put her body on the line
in a situation like that…

22:33.477 --> 22:35.187
Sounds like she loves him or something.

22:36.980 --> 22:37.814
Oh, that's right.

22:37.898 --> 22:40.400
The next Heritage Lounge meetup
is scheduled for the 15th.

22:40.484 --> 22:43.236
Oh, we have a guest lecturer too.
So you're coming, right?

22:44.488 --> 22:45.364
Uh,

22:46.156 --> 22:46.990
yeah.

23:16.978 --> 23:18.647
I still can't sleep.

23:20.524 --> 23:21.900
She's getting on my nerves.

23:23.735 --> 23:24.945
I need you.

23:45.590 --> 23:47.551
That woman got hurt because of me.

24:03.817 --> 24:04.985
It's bothering me.

24:28.467 --> 24:30.385
She's getting on my nerves.

24:31.636 --> 24:32.846
It's bothering me.

25:03.084 --> 25:06.254
…with the free kick
in the center of the park,

25:06.338 --> 25:10.091
trying to build up play from the back
as they're so used to doing.

25:10.175 --> 25:13.470
Do you think, Alex,
they need a plan B at times like this?

25:14.179 --> 25:15.388
They are the type of team…

25:15.472 --> 25:17.015
So you just left it that way?

25:26.942 --> 25:28.401
It's a scratch. Don't worry.

25:31.738 --> 25:33.907
Let's just watch soccer, okay?

25:44.209 --> 25:45.544
What's your phone number?

25:46.211 --> 25:48.421
I never actually saved it,
so I couldn't reach you.

25:48.505 --> 25:52.259
Well, if you had called,
would you have said you'd be late, then?

25:52.842 --> 25:53.677
Yeah.

25:55.095 --> 25:57.055
I would've told you not to cook for me.

25:57.597 --> 25:58.932
Not that you'd listen.

26:07.190 --> 26:08.400
Here you go.

26:18.326 --> 26:20.579
NOH IN-JI

26:28.670 --> 26:30.589
Why do you like this kind of marriage?

26:31.673 --> 26:33.091
And just answer me straight.

26:40.807 --> 26:42.642
Well, it was about revenge.

26:43.977 --> 26:45.812
That was why I started anyway.

26:47.230 --> 26:49.983
Now I'm starting to see
I actually have a gift for this.

26:54.904 --> 26:56.364
Now you tell me something.

26:56.990 --> 26:59.409
How about why
you can't stand those lights?

27:13.506 --> 27:14.883
My dad attached…

27:17.761 --> 27:19.387
cameras to that chandelier…

27:21.514 --> 27:22.807
to spy on my mother.

27:24.476 --> 27:26.019
My mother was skinny,

27:26.102 --> 27:28.313
but she could take a few punches,
for sure.

27:30.065 --> 27:31.107
After a while,

27:32.067 --> 27:33.443
she went insane.

27:37.697 --> 27:39.240
Our house was a hellhole.

27:42.035 --> 27:45.413
And he wouldn't take her to the hospital,
so no one knew about it.

27:47.874 --> 27:49.834
Then her sleepwalking got so bad that I…

27:51.336 --> 27:53.296
I just followed her around every night.

27:55.382 --> 27:57.258
I was afraid she'd kill herself.

28:14.442 --> 28:16.986
That was before
my father started beating me.

28:18.697 --> 28:21.408
I could have tried to stop him,
and I still don't know…

28:24.202 --> 28:25.328
why I didn't.

28:31.459 --> 28:32.669
Yeah.

28:33.253 --> 28:35.296
That's why I can't stand those lights.

28:45.598 --> 28:47.851
I don't know why you'd go into all that.

28:51.062 --> 28:53.106
You said you weren't going to charm me.

28:55.817 --> 28:58.361
You said I should just try
to be myself, right?

28:59.571 --> 29:00.822
And I've thought about it.

29:01.322 --> 29:02.741
It makes no difference.

29:03.450 --> 29:06.745
It's like telling a secret
to someone who's not there.

29:09.164 --> 29:12.500
And you have to keep my secrets.
It's mandatory, isn't it?

29:36.900 --> 29:38.318
This should help you sleep.

29:39.611 --> 29:40.945
It's jasmine tea.

29:51.998 --> 29:52.999
It's really good.

30:02.050 --> 30:04.761
Once I'm done writing my book,
we should go on a trip.

30:05.637 --> 30:06.805
That might work.

30:08.097 --> 30:10.350
Let's just do it.
I know I can make it work.

30:13.728 --> 30:14.604
Let's just go.

30:15.313 --> 30:16.940
Come on, huh?

30:17.023 --> 30:18.274
Hang on a sec. Hang on.

30:21.069 --> 30:22.320
Hey.

30:22.403 --> 30:23.655
- Hey!
- Hey, give me an answer.

30:23.738 --> 30:25.406
One second.

30:28.201 --> 30:29.244
Yeah, hello?

30:34.707 --> 30:35.542
Yes.

31:14.038 --> 31:16.833
WIFE

31:31.723 --> 31:32.724
Uh, hello?

31:45.820 --> 31:46.988
So?

31:48.740 --> 31:51.659
He's sleeping, but I shouldn't…
but I shouldn't wake him.

31:51.743 --> 31:52.952
He hasn't slept in days.

31:55.538 --> 31:56.748
I mean, is it urgent?

32:02.170 --> 32:05.048
His dad's in the hospital.
He's been sick for a while.

32:06.341 --> 32:07.717
He's doing better now though.

32:08.801 --> 32:10.553
Give me a sec. He should hear this.

32:11.095 --> 32:12.013
That's okay.

32:12.972 --> 32:15.224
Even if he came right now,
it wouldn't matter.

32:16.809 --> 32:18.311
Please tell him I called.

32:19.228 --> 32:21.272
His father is going to be totally fine.

32:22.815 --> 32:23.650
Okay.

32:24.984 --> 32:26.444
Okay, I'll relay that.

32:27.278 --> 32:28.613
Did Jeong-won

32:30.156 --> 32:31.491
take a bunch of pills tonight?

32:35.203 --> 32:36.788
I mean, you said he's out.

32:38.748 --> 32:39.791
Uh, no.

32:40.708 --> 32:42.293
He fell asleep on his own.

32:43.503 --> 32:44.462
Really?

32:46.464 --> 32:47.298
Ah.

32:51.928 --> 32:52.929
Okay.

33:28.589 --> 33:31.551
- Hey, stop it! It's mine!
- No, I already said it's mine!

33:31.634 --> 33:33.720
Hwan, hey!
Hwan gets a turn now, all right?

33:33.803 --> 33:36.014
- I said it's mine!
- Hey! Keep it down!

33:36.097 --> 33:38.141
- Hwan! Come on. Take turns!
- Get off me!

33:38.641 --> 33:41.185
As if I don't have enough
on my plate this morning. Jesus!

33:41.269 --> 33:43.604
I really can't drive today.
Just cut me a little slack.

33:44.105 --> 33:46.399
And if I take a taxi,
I'm gonna throw up mid-ride.

33:48.151 --> 33:49.694
- Oh God.
- What the fuck?

33:49.777 --> 33:50.862
That little shithead.

33:50.945 --> 33:52.989
What the… What the…
What the… What the…

33:54.365 --> 33:56.909
- What the fuck? What the fuck?
- They can hear you.

33:56.993 --> 34:00.079
Shit like that don't come to their senses
until somebody smashes into their ass.

34:00.163 --> 34:02.582
Oh, come on, calm down.
You're giving me motion sickness.

34:02.665 --> 34:04.709
Oh, give me a break. Who got drunk, huh?

34:04.792 --> 34:05.793
Right.

34:06.544 --> 34:07.962
This is all my fault.

34:08.046 --> 34:11.174
We won't have enough money to remodel
even after a bank loan.

34:11.257 --> 34:13.051
Maybe we only fix half.

34:13.134 --> 34:16.888
I guess. Or you could ask Jeong-won
and borrow some money.

34:16.971 --> 34:18.431
What is he, UNICEF?

34:18.973 --> 34:20.016
Though, I mean,

34:20.892 --> 34:24.145
he's got so much money,
he probably wouldn't notice it's gone.

34:24.228 --> 34:28.441
All right, I'll… see if the bank
will extend our credit line.

34:28.524 --> 34:31.861
I make just enough to get by running
a tiny, hole-in-the-wall record label,

34:31.944 --> 34:32.779
you know?

34:33.279 --> 34:36.532
Honestly, having Jeong-won as an employee
is so disorienting.

34:37.033 --> 34:38.326
Like, am I rich too, or what?

34:39.035 --> 34:41.120
Hey, honey, could we move away?

34:41.704 --> 34:44.499
'Cause I don't think Jeong-won
is ever gonna quit. Ever.

34:44.582 --> 34:47.168
- Stop it!
- Give it to me. I wanna see it!

34:47.251 --> 34:49.629
Ow, ow! He's hurting me!
He's twisting my arm!

34:49.712 --> 34:51.047
I told you to cut it out!

34:51.130 --> 34:52.256
I want it! Get off!

34:52.340 --> 34:53.341
Oh, I hate you!

35:38.928 --> 35:40.012
You're awake.

35:42.515 --> 35:45.351
Did I… fall asleep out here?

35:45.935 --> 35:48.479
I mean, I couldn't move you
to your room on my own.

35:51.983 --> 35:54.277
So the hospital is first on the agenda.

35:57.280 --> 35:59.782
We're going for you. It is your father.

36:02.034 --> 36:04.745
It's a shame.
He was doing so well up until now.

36:05.288 --> 36:07.456
It's a good thing
your wife was here though.

36:08.332 --> 36:09.959
So you were on Jeju Island?

36:11.836 --> 36:12.670
Yes.

36:28.561 --> 36:30.521
Why didn't you drop dead last night?

36:32.148 --> 36:33.399
In your sleep.

36:43.075 --> 36:44.952
NO RECENT MISSED CALLS

36:47.038 --> 36:49.916
Did Jeong-won
take a bunch of pills tonight?

36:50.499 --> 36:51.918
I mean, you said he's out.

36:52.835 --> 36:53.961
Uh, no.

36:54.879 --> 36:56.631
He fell asleep on his own.

37:44.178 --> 37:45.221
What are you doing?

37:45.304 --> 37:46.764
Helping you take care of it.

37:49.475 --> 37:53.396
Even if spouses watch their partners
do wrong, they aren't liable legally.

37:56.941 --> 37:59.318
Unfortunately,
you gotta have a good lawyer.

38:01.362 --> 38:03.030
That being said, I know one.

38:06.075 --> 38:06.993
It's him.

38:09.161 --> 38:10.413
You want revenge?

38:16.335 --> 38:17.461
Thanks so much.

38:35.813 --> 38:37.398
So looks like we won.

38:38.482 --> 38:40.693
He's alive
but doesn't get to eat amazing food.

38:46.949 --> 38:48.284
You do this for all your clients?

38:50.453 --> 38:51.454
Do what?

38:52.038 --> 38:53.706
You left something on my pillow.

38:56.500 --> 38:58.210
It's like a little voodoo doll.

38:59.420 --> 39:01.589
You keep it, and you poke it with needles.

39:06.052 --> 39:08.304
Baby powder that's inside.

39:09.305 --> 39:13.267
I could always go to sleep if I had it,
even if I was scared of thunderstorms.

39:20.066 --> 39:21.108
Thanks to you…

39:23.778 --> 39:26.530
I slept well
for the first time in six months.

39:27.406 --> 39:29.075
It's good to hear that it worked.

39:41.837 --> 39:42.838
"Wife."

39:45.800 --> 39:47.510
That's how she's saved on your phone.

39:48.636 --> 39:49.887
Have you talked to her?

39:51.389 --> 39:53.391
That's not your concern. Stay out of it.

39:53.933 --> 39:55.017
I'll take care of it.

39:55.101 --> 39:56.769
She asked me if you took pills last night.

40:03.859 --> 40:06.278
I doubt you'd do anything
she didn't want you to.

40:08.864 --> 40:10.116
Plus, she hasn't cut you off.

40:13.661 --> 40:15.663
She's the one
who recommended the pills, huh?

40:28.926 --> 40:32.096
Please make sure those vinyl covers
are fitting properly up there.

40:32.179 --> 40:34.473
- Okay.
- I want precision cuts on all the pieces.

40:34.557 --> 40:37.101
- Mr. uh… Mr. Oh, uh, um…
- Sh! Shut up, all right!

40:48.320 --> 40:49.697
HAN JEONG-WON

41:00.541 --> 41:01.709
You picked up.

41:03.169 --> 41:06.505
I'm sorry they contacted you
about my dad yesterday.

41:06.589 --> 41:09.091
It's fine.
He really wasn't the best father-in-law,

41:09.175 --> 41:10.759
but I owed the guy.

41:13.679 --> 41:15.764
- Let's get a tea.
- Next time.

41:15.848 --> 41:17.266
I have to go now.

41:19.143 --> 41:20.102
All right.

41:23.022 --> 41:25.191
I'll bring the lights over
when they get there.

41:25.274 --> 41:26.734
Make sure to run up the bill.

41:28.652 --> 41:29.778
You look pretty good.

41:30.571 --> 41:33.741
I fell asleep on the sofa.
Conked out. Without pills too.

41:35.201 --> 41:37.244
That did happen now and then, didn't it?

41:40.581 --> 41:41.790
Look, I better head out.

41:42.291 --> 41:43.167
Right.

41:59.517 --> 42:00.601
Ah Jesus.

42:04.647 --> 42:07.316
Oh shit. I always forget this.

42:10.694 --> 42:12.279
The passcode, what is it?

42:14.573 --> 42:16.283
Oh great. Oh Christ.

42:17.159 --> 42:18.118
Goddammit!

42:20.204 --> 42:22.206
Sure, make yourself at home.

42:22.289 --> 42:25.459
Yeah, you're one to talk, Ms. Do-dam.
That's my coffee machine, ya know.

42:25.543 --> 42:28.170
Yeah, I know,
which is why I'm gonna get you one,

42:28.254 --> 42:29.255
you bitchy tart.

42:30.798 --> 42:32.883
Well, looks like I did you a favor, then.

42:33.467 --> 42:35.761
You know how much cholesterol
is in three cups of this?

42:35.844 --> 42:38.305
Oh, in that case,
feel free to pass on the coffee.

42:38.389 --> 42:40.516
How can I resist
when it's just sitting there?

42:41.016 --> 42:41.934
I get it.

42:43.102 --> 42:45.229
Why are you here now?

42:45.312 --> 42:46.564
Go to work, girl.

42:47.523 --> 42:50.025
I warned you. You're destined
to bust your ass for table scraps.

42:50.109 --> 42:51.443
Astrology doesn't lie.

42:51.944 --> 42:55.322
Aw, cool it! You don't think
I have it hard enough as it is?

42:55.406 --> 42:58.492
I mean, you know
I have problems to deal with, right?

42:59.076 --> 43:00.452
What kind of problems, huh?

43:04.123 --> 43:06.792
- Remember that Eom Tae-seong guy?
- Who?

43:06.875 --> 43:09.211
It's that asshole who was stalking In-ji.

43:09.295 --> 43:11.589
They released him
from the mental institution.

43:12.590 --> 43:15.676
Who knows what that bastard
might try next. You see the issue?

43:16.176 --> 43:18.929
Turn him in! That's what taxes are for!

43:19.013 --> 43:20.472
We can't involve the police.

43:20.556 --> 43:21.765
Why?

43:22.558 --> 43:24.310
We can't. We just can't.

43:25.644 --> 43:28.147
Just listen. They'll let anyone off
with a slap on the wrist,

43:28.230 --> 43:29.440
even if it's something serious.

43:29.523 --> 43:31.400
A suspended sentence? It's bullshit.

43:34.695 --> 43:36.947
Why do you spend so much energy
looking out for In-ji?

43:37.531 --> 43:39.158
You've got enough to deal with.

43:41.619 --> 43:44.747
I really don't care if I die.
I gotta take care of her.

43:44.830 --> 43:48.042
Oh, sure.
What are you, a goddamn saint?

43:48.876 --> 43:51.503
What exactly
did this creepy asshole do anyway?

43:52.379 --> 43:55.883
Eom Tae-seong single-handedly
ruined In-ji's entire life!

43:55.966 --> 43:58.093
If you knew what that shitheel did to her…

44:00.054 --> 44:01.555
This is serious stuff.

44:09.521 --> 44:11.231
Oh crap. You're kidding.

44:13.359 --> 44:16.195
That's it. I'm gonna get him.
I'm gonna murder this guy.

44:48.977 --> 44:50.562
It's about Eom Tae-seong.

44:51.188 --> 44:52.398
I guess he's back.

45:01.115 --> 45:03.325
- Thanks, guy.
- Yep. Go ahead.

45:48.704 --> 45:51.707
You know, I was just thinking…
This is the perfect day

45:51.790 --> 45:54.251
to enjoy a few cups
of nice, freshly brewed tea.

45:54.918 --> 45:56.962
You were destined to have some, Ms. Lee.

45:58.630 --> 45:59.506
Yes.

46:03.343 --> 46:05.721
How's Jeong-won? Is he all right?

46:08.015 --> 46:09.725
He's great, as far as I know.

46:10.934 --> 46:13.145
That's why you have
that look on your face.

46:14.521 --> 46:16.982
Well, I was the one
who arranged the whole situation.

46:17.483 --> 46:20.986
That sounds like… a test to me,
is that right?

46:21.069 --> 46:24.448
You're doing this because you want him
all to yourself, but he's elusive.

46:24.531 --> 46:26.950
You probably want to be
in control though, right?

46:33.540 --> 46:36.043
I have to say,
I don't think I'm that twisted though.

46:36.627 --> 46:37.836
No.

46:37.920 --> 46:39.755
Absolutely not, dear.

46:42.090 --> 46:46.011
Sorry. Uh, the man who'll be leading
our gathering is waiting.

46:46.094 --> 46:47.679
He'd like to introduce himself.

47:10.118 --> 47:11.036
Allez!

47:23.674 --> 47:25.342
Allez! That's a hit.

48:32.701 --> 48:33.827
Can I touch you?

48:35.829 --> 48:36.788
Uh, no.

48:37.706 --> 48:39.166
Then what are you doing here?

48:39.249 --> 48:42.377
I came to see you.
I guess I shouldn't have.

48:58.727 --> 49:01.647
Just go away. Get outta here, okay?
Come on. Time to go!

49:01.730 --> 49:02.606
Get 'em out.

49:02.689 --> 49:04.942
Sorry, folks.
I need everybody to clear out.

49:05.025 --> 49:06.818
Please go home. Thank you.

49:14.993 --> 49:16.495
Hey, they can't go this way!

49:16.578 --> 49:18.747
That chest wound
must've been the lethal one.

49:19.831 --> 49:21.249
I wonder how many there are.

49:21.833 --> 49:22.751
What?

49:23.502 --> 49:24.544
In the water.

49:25.170 --> 49:27.172
There's gotta be lots of fish out there.

49:28.715 --> 49:32.052
I dunno if it's 'cause I quit cigarettes.
This thing is making me hungry.

49:32.552 --> 49:34.388
There's a loach soup place
down the road

49:34.471 --> 49:36.348
and an entrail soup place
right next to it.

49:43.730 --> 49:45.691
Hey, wrong direction. It's the other way.

49:55.701 --> 49:59.121
I fell asleep on the sofa.
Conked out. Without pills too.

50:01.748 --> 50:04.459
Uh, no. He fell asleep on his own.

50:12.634 --> 50:14.970
Hi, Mr. Kim. I wanna head over there.

50:15.554 --> 50:16.722
Will you let them know?

50:40.037 --> 50:42.998
I'm Lee Seo-yeon. Uh, Jeong-won's ex-wife.

50:43.832 --> 50:44.666
Hi.

50:45.709 --> 50:47.002
Noh In-ji. Pleasure.

50:53.675 --> 50:56.678
- Let's raise it two keys.
- All right, two keys up.

51:08.023 --> 51:11.818
Yo, let's knock off early.
Go to a fancy restaurant.

51:12.444 --> 51:13.361
Come on.

51:13.987 --> 51:16.656
Sorry, dude. Don't think I can right now.

51:17.157 --> 51:18.075
Why not?

51:20.327 --> 51:21.661
Eating at home tonight.

51:31.338 --> 51:34.091
Oh my God. I'm sorry.
My hands keep slipping.

51:35.509 --> 51:38.345
It's all right.
I'll just use the bathroom.

51:39.012 --> 51:39.930
Sure.

53:03.013 --> 53:05.265
NOH IN-JI

53:07.642 --> 53:09.144
NOH IN-JI

53:09.227 --> 53:10.979
DO YOU TRUST HER?

53:24.534 --> 53:27.954
The number you have dialed
is no longer in service.

53:28.038 --> 53:29.414
Please hang up and dial…

53:36.838 --> 53:38.089
Do you trust that woman?

53:40.217 --> 53:42.135
- Who?
- That woman.

53:42.677 --> 53:44.429
The one Seo-yeon set you up with.

53:46.097 --> 53:47.682
You think she's gonna be on your side?

53:48.975 --> 53:50.185
Just keep your guard up

53:50.894 --> 53:52.437
so she doesn't screw you over.

54:03.657 --> 54:07.369
So you're saying
Ms. Noh In-Ji is the owner of that trunk?

54:09.371 --> 54:10.247
Yes.

54:11.081 --> 54:13.291
Whenever she got a new post,
she'd take it with her.

54:14.376 --> 54:16.461
- "Post," you said?
- Yeah.

54:17.671 --> 54:19.172
What does she do for work?

54:20.757 --> 54:24.135
I don't know any specifics,
but she'd get sent all over the place.

54:24.719 --> 54:26.846
You mean to tell me
you don't even know where she works?

54:26.930 --> 54:28.014
You're best friends?

54:29.432 --> 54:33.019
Are you familiar with that leaked video
from the Blooming Hotel?

54:34.896 --> 54:37.357
The scandal
completely ruined her marriage.

54:38.191 --> 54:39.776
We stopped talking after that.

54:43.113 --> 54:44.155
Mm.

54:45.991 --> 54:46.992
I understand.

55:01.131 --> 55:02.799
When we first bought the house,

55:03.383 --> 55:05.885
I decided to renovate the entire interior.

55:08.138 --> 55:10.098
Well, except the chandelier, of course.

55:12.183 --> 55:14.477
I assumed
it would be perfect for the space.

55:16.604 --> 55:20.108
But now I feel bad for keeping it,
given what happened.

55:20.608 --> 55:22.193
It's not a problem, Seo-yeon.

55:22.819 --> 55:24.279
Things always get broken.

55:26.823 --> 55:29.075
Well, I ordered some new lights
from France.

55:30.994 --> 55:32.454
Jeong-won asked me to, actually.

55:35.165 --> 55:35.999
Right.

55:44.591 --> 55:46.634
That's enough small talk for now.

55:47.761 --> 55:49.095
You know who I am.

55:50.638 --> 55:52.057
Don't you have a question?

55:57.062 --> 55:58.563
You know who I am, right?

56:09.407 --> 56:10.450
Yeah, I do.

56:13.286 --> 56:15.372
You are the architect, Lee Seo-yeon.
